<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Blur</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Bella Kay</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">My Reckless Abandon</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">4asmKFh6Z5iTdJkxqC2wKQ</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:00.839" end="00:08.839">You're so sweet, I hate that</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:11.020" end="00:14.685">But we compromise 'cause we fight real bad</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:14.685" end="00:18.590">That's when I want you, no, I need you fast</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:18.590" end="00:20.280" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Take it to the brim)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.280" end="00:24.572">You know I love causin' problems</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.572" end="00:27.857">Pull me close and watch you solve 'em</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.857" end="00:30.499">Don't tempt me, I know that it's bad</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.499" end="00:32.529">But you like when I'm messy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.529" end="00:35.056">I'm thinkin' that we</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.056" end="00:38.314">Could be in the kitchen or the bathroom floor</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.314" end="00:41.840">Might be in my head, but when we're in your car</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.840" end="00:44.230">You're drivin' me home</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.230" end="00:46.409">I'm wishin' you weren't</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.409" end="00:49.153">I can, I can see</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.153" end="00:52.040">I can see your bedroom from the balcony</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.040" end="00:55.585">Baby, I can also see your hands on me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.585" end="00:58.616">I know there's a line (Yеah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.616" end="01:01.927">But I think it should blur (Yeah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.927" end="01:08.772">I think it should, blur (Oh, oh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.772" end="01:16.187">I think it should, blur (Oh, oh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.187" end="01:20.823">Can I get somethin' off my chеst? (Off the chest)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.823" end="01:23.764">I wanna do it where you do your best</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.764" end="01:27.824">Work me out, breath to breath (Alright)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.824" end="01:30.083">Say I'm crazy, do you wanna bet?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.083" end="01:34.148">You know I love causin' problems (I love it)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.148" end="01:37.387">Pull me close and watch you solve 'em</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.387" end="01:40.041">Don't tempt me, I know that it's bad</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.041" end="01:42.257">But you like when I'm messy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.257" end="01:44.676">I'm thinkin' that we</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.676" end="01:47.923">Could be in the kitchen or the bathroom floor (Floor)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:47.923" end="01:51.488">Might be in my head, but when we're in your car</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:51.488" end="01:53.145">You're drivin' me home (I)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.145" end="01:57.192">I'm wishin' you weren't (I wish you weren't, I wish you weren't)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:57.192" end="01:58.692">I can, I can see</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.666" end="02:01.743">I can see your bedroom from the balcony (The balcony)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:01.743" end="02:05.192">Baby, I can also see your hands on me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:05.192" end="02:08.296">I know there's a line (I know, I know)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:08.296" end="02:12.126">But I think it should blur (Blur, blur, blur)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:12.126" end="02:17.598">I think it should blur (I doubt it, blur)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:17.598" end="02:23.606">I think it should, it should blur</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:23.606" end="02:30.608">(How, how, how long?) How long?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:30.608" end="02:33.487">(How, how, how long?) How long can we take it?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:33.487" end="02:37.310">(How, how, how long?) How wrong?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:37.310" end="02:40.739">(How, how, how long?) How wrong can we make it?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:40.739" end="02:44.536">(How, how, how long?) How, how long?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:44.536" end="02:47.515">(How, how, how long?) How long can we take it?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:47.515" end="02:52.148">(How, how, how long?) How, how wrong?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:52.148" end="02:55.874">(How, how, how long?) How wrong can we make it? Ah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:55.874" end="02:59.212">Could be in the kitchen or the bathroom floor</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:59.212" end="03:02.821">Might be in my head, but when we're in your car</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:02.821" end="03:05.568">You're drivin' me home (I know, I know)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:05.568" end="03:08.325">I'm wishin' you weren't (I wish you weren't, I wish you weren't)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:08.325" end="03:09.988">I can, I can see</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:09.988" end="03:13.064">I can see your bedroom from the balcony (The balcony)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:13.064" end="03:16.548">Baby, I can also see your hands on me (Oh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:16.548" end="03:19.389">I know there's a line (I know, I know)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:19.389" end="03:23.141">But I think it should blur (I think, I think, I think)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:23.141" end="03:29.105">I think it should, blur (It should, it should)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:29.105" end="03:33.105">I think it should, blur (Do you want it us to blur?)</p></div></body></tt>